00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:06.410
♬ Trodden-down snow is super dangerous ♬

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:11.500
♬ You fall flat just like that ♬

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.750
♬ Can't get up ♬

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.040
♬ Can't stand up ♬

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:18.840
♬ It's super dangerous, super dangerous ♬

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:26.220
♬ I ache in every part of my body
and my heart (They ache!) ♬

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.560
♬ Speaking up at the morning meeting ♬

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:31.140
♬ was super scary ♬

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:35.940
♬ My proposal fell flat just like that ♬

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.360
♬ We need new ideas ♬

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.900
♬ Don't be afraid (Say) ♬

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:45.780
♬ Say what you think...
isn't that what you told me? ♬

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.290
♬ The air in the room froze white ♬

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:53.170
♬ Like a cloudy midwinter sky (Sky) ♬

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.630
♬ I just wanted warmth (That's all) ♬

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:57.920
♬ My hand had the shivers ♬

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:02.930
♬ I aimed for "Hot" (Hot) ♬

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:02.920
"Hot"

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:05.390
♬ But I hit the wrong button (Hit) ♬

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:10.230
♬ And what was delivered...
was "Cold" (Cold) ♬

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:15.020
♬ Trodden-down snow is super dangerous ♬

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.030
♬ You fall flat just like that ♬

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:22.240
♬ A campfire couldn't even start ♬

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:24.820
♬ To thaw my numb, frozen heart ♬

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.120
♬ Ice-cold (my heart) ♬

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:27.280
♬ Wind whistles through (my wallet) ♬

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:33.540
♬ And echoes emptily in the night
(the bragging of the older staff) ♬

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.960
♬ La la la, doo de doo ♬

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:42.720
♬ La la la la la... (Doo de doo de doo) ♬

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.890
Hmm...

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:54.600
Seriously! No matter how many times
I watch it, this is good! Genius!

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:56.730
This really looks wintery!

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:57.900
Really, how should I put it...

00:22:57.900 --> 00:22:59.980
--Yeah.
--It really is... wintery!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.190
--Uh-huh.
--And then, it's like... wintery!

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:04.030
--Yep!
--Right?

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:05.910
--Yeah.
--It's wintery, isn't it?

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:09.740
--Uh-huh.
--And to this degree of perfection!
It's indeed wintery!

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:12.160
Derekida-<i>san</i>.

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:15.250
K-Kumatani-<i>kun</i>! D-Did you cut
your hair by any chance?

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:16.920
It looks super good on you.

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:17.750
What?

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:21.550
I-I mean... You're looking good
in that costume again.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:22.840
Did something good happen?

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:24.550
Let's get started with the shoot.

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:26.430
R-Right!

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:28.800
Hey, ADs! Hurry up!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:32.180
How long are you gonna be excited
by such a pathetic MV?!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:35.520
Now! Hurry up and get ready!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.310
He said "pathetic."

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:35.520
Yep, he did.

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:38.100
Hurry up! Seriously!

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:38.100
That was quite a quick change in attitude.

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:43.900
After that, the director's absurd demands
got a little more reasonable.

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:46.570
We'll begin the shoot now!
